<section class="pb-16 sm:pb-24 pt-4 sm:pt-8">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-12 sm:gap-16">
    <section>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight">
        I’m Javad. I build software and figure things out along the way.
      </h1>
    </section>


    <section>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight pb-6 pt-5">Projects</h2>
      <p class="pb-8 text-base sm:text-lg font-normal leading-relaxed text-subtle-light">
        Some things I build with other people. Some I build on my own. Some work out. Some don't. A few are still unfinished.
      </p>
      <div class="space-y-10">
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold">ScoutSpin</h3>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-base sm:text-lg font-normal leading-relaxed text-subtle-light">
            <p>
              I’m building ScoutSpin to help table tennis players find equipment that fits their game.
            </p>
            <p>
              There are thousands of blades and rubbers to choose from, and comparing them is harder than it should be.
            </p>
            <p>It’s still being built.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold"><%= link_to "Spinyard", "https://spinyardhq.com", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener", class: "underline decoration-subtle-light underline-offset-4 decoration-2 hover:decoration-primary hover:text-primary transition-colors" %></h3>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-base sm:text-lg font-normal leading-relaxed text-subtle-light">
            <p>
              Spinyard is a table tennis analytics project. I’m building it to help players get more information from their match footage.
            </p>
            <p>
              It’s also still a work in progress. I’m figuring out what is actually useful before trying to build too much around it.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold"><%= link_to "Venonwood", "https://venonwood.biz/", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener", class: "underline decoration-subtle-light underline-offset-4 decoration-2 hover:decoration-primary hover:text-primary transition-colors" %></h3>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-base sm:text-lg font-normal leading-relaxed text-subtle-light">
            <p>
              I’m a co-founder of Venonwood, a company that builds industrial wood-drying equipment.
            </p>
            <p>
              I’ve worked on the software side of the business, but the interesting part is that the software is connected to real machines: sensors, PLCs, control systems, and dryers running in the real world.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold"><%= link_to "Dropball", "https://dropball-game.ir/", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener", class: "underline decoration-subtle-light underline-offset-4 decoration-2 hover:decoration-primary hover:text-primary transition-colors" %></h3>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-base sm:text-lg font-normal leading-relaxed text-subtle-light">
            <p>
              I’m a co-founder of Dropball, a football quiz app that I built with others.
            </p>
            <p>It started as a small idea and turned into a real product. I’m still involved with it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h3 class="font-serif text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold">Buildcue</h3>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-base sm:text-lg font-normal leading-relaxed text-subtle-light">
            <p>
              Buildcue is my company for the software I build independently.
            </p>
            <p>ScoutSpin and Spinyard are being built under Buildcue.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
  <%= render "subscribers/subscribe" %>
</section>
